  "2026-10-12T03:15:50.074Z","harness:codex","Measured package proof: unchanged base gate rejected the initial candidate at 20012873 bytes. Removing only declaration indentation reduced the actual production distribution to 19887110 bytes (1655 files), while preserving exact string/template literal contents, JSDoc bytes, public type syntax and stable repeated finalization. Independent TypeScript printer equivalence and the real Git/reopen/risk acceptance pass. Typecheck and full coverage are running; no runtime-symbol minification or budget increase is used."
  "2026-10-12T05:35:02.469Z","harness:codex","Final acceptance: linked declaration finalizer tests and four-project TypeScript pass. Fresh packed strict TypeScript and Node/Bun public SDK consumers pass after the final source changes; npx/bunx smoke passes nine packages. Final base distribution 19887159/20000000 bytes and pristine Sentry-injected distribution 20129951/20250000 bytes pass unchanged ceilings; bundled runtime dependency bytes are separately measured. Independent printer equivalence, exact literal/template/comment contents and repeated byte-stable finalization pass. Complete-source coverage is exact 100/100/100/100; no symbols, documentation, thresholds or source readability were removed."
