  "2026-10-12T05:40:22.069Z","harness:codex","Upstream review update: PR235 changed from inspected head3162a067c6adb2ef277a2ed0fbf8908b2ee6cf64 to3a030442f13ee5db02b0371517935adc2f5a9c62 while its owner was actively correcting a new CodeRabbit evidence finding. That supersedes the earlier green-head receipt. The existing owner already replied with the narrowed claims; avoid duplicate replies, competing tracker edits or merging stale review evidence. Continue our four-item delivery independently and verify the final upstream head separately."
